_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spec 0001 has no ID-bearing criteria or Build plan for this slice, so the build notes must carry both; otherwise developer, checker and tester have no reference."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_scaffold_as_build_it", "label": "Decision: 'Scaffold from the decision' treated as Build it, closed together with Verify it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scope 001 has no milestone; one checker closes Scaffold and Verify after the developer branch is merged."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_no_pr_change_path", "label": "Decision: scope 001 change path without PR (branch per sub session, lead --no-ff merge, push main at closing)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Follows the /coordinate flow; required CI only arrives in scope 002. The handoff asks the build notes to name this path."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_graph_ownership", "label": "Decision: sub sessions do not run graphify or commit graphify-out; lead updates the graph in the merge commit on main", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L30", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "graphify-out/ is tracked in git, so per-branch graph updates would conflict on graph.json; deviates from the letter of AGENTS.md step 6 for sub session branch commits."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_peer_sessions_stackly", "label": "Decision: all peer sessions belong to the Stackly project; one busy peer counts toward the 4 session limit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No other sessions or branches exist in this repo."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_five_sessions_first_turn", "label": "Decision: five sessions started on the first user turn (one live, four standby)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "start_session can be refused on a turn triggered by another session."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_decision_session_start_retry_worktree_base", "label": "Decision: first session start refused on a graph-notification turn; sessions started after the user typed Lanjut, standby worktrees cut from 1246c0d and merge main on start", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The app refused start_session on a turn triggered by a graph update notification. Worktrees live under /Users/ojiepermana/worktrees/pool/<name>-<hash>; the four standby worktrees were cut from 1246c0d (origin/main), not 6856ec8, so they read shared rules and roles from the main checkout and run git merge main when told to start."}, {"id": "docs_scope_coordination_001_stack_and_workspace_log_delegated_decisions", "label": "Keputusan delegasi (delegated spec decisions taken on the user's behalf; none yet)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/scope/coordination/001-stack-and-workspace.log.md", "source_location": "L